<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-DAUPHINE LIBERE FIRST STAGE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-DAUPHINE LIBERE FIRST STAGE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>VILLEURBANNE, France 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
