<p>the 167-km first stage of the Dauphine Libere cycling race form</p>
<p>Grenoble on Monday.</p>
<p>1. Dzhamolidin Abduzhaparov (Uzbekistan) Lotto 4 hours 21 minutes 47 seconds</p>
